PN,49611
SC,0011
CT,25,T
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F496A1775044735
OL,1,Vk4                              G11/27
OL,2,Vj5{5jj5~sGOPPOSITION CROWDS
OL,3,Vj5op0ozz5pGDISPERSED IN ALBANIA
OL,5, Police have dispersed large crowds
OL,6, outside the opposition headquarters of
OL,7, the Democratic Party in Tirana, Albania
OL,9,FDemocratic leader Sali Berisha had
OL,10,Fappealed to the crowd for calm
OL,11,Ffollowing yesterday's first post-war
OL,12,Fmulti-party elections in the country.
OL,13,F
OL,14,FHe said the Democratic Party would
OL,15,Fanalyse the election results before
OL,16,Fdeciding whether to accept them.
OL,17,F
OL,18,FBritish Euro-MP Edward McMillan-Scott,
OL,19,Fwho visited Albania as an observer, has
OL,20,Fsaid Communist domination of the media
OL,21,Fprevented a fully fair election.
OL,22,F
OL,23,D]FFromG01-04-91F/ teletextarchive.com
