OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F496A1775044735
OL,1,Vk4                              G12/27
OL,2,Vj5{5jj5~sGFOUR DIE IN BANK
OL,3,Vj5op0ozz5pGHOLIDAY PILE-UP
OL,4,D
OL,5, Four members of one family, thought to
OL,6, be from Bournemouth, have been killed
OL,7, in a four-car pile up near Oxford.
OL,9,FThe family's car collided with three
OL,10,Fothers on the A420, about 15 miles west
OL,11,Fof the city, just after midday.
OL,13,FThe driver was taken to the John
OL,14,FRadcliffe hospital suffering from
OL,15,Fshock. The dead were thought to be his
OL,16,Fwife, mother, aunt and daughter.
OL,17,F
OL,18,FAnother woman was also being treated in
OL,19,Fhospital for facial, leg and chest
OL,20,Finjuries. Thames Valley police promised
OL,21,Fa full inquiry into the accident.
OL,23,D]FFromG01-04-91F/ teletextarchive.com
